{"timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:20:36.988Z","type":"tool","step":"IDLE","details":{"toolName":"mdocs","args":{"command":"initiative.create","args":{"id":"design-redesign","title":"Design Redesign — Exploration Library","tags":["design","redesign","ui","stitch","etheric-pro"],"objective":"Redesign the AerialDB exploration library to match the new Stitch design mockups (Etheric Pro / Digital Observatory design system). Organized into 9 stages, each building on the previous.","plan":"## Stages\n\n1. **Design Tokens & Visual Foundation** — Update colors, surfaces, typography, borders\n2. **Header & Navigation Redesign** — Full navigation bar with glassmorphic styling\n3. **Filter System Redesign** — Dropdown filters replacing chips; add `style` dimension\n4. **Move Card Redesign** — Stats, type icons, badges; add `move_type` and `view_count` columns\n5. **Hero Banner Update** — Description, Watch Tutorial, Save to Library buttons\n6. **Library Explorer Sidebar (Logged In)** — Move type filters, grid/list toggle\n7. **Footer & Static Pages** — Footer, Tutorials/Theory/Community pages, legal pages\n8. **Upload Flow & User Library (Deferred)**\n9. **Premium Tier (Fully Deferred)**\n\n## Database Migrations Needed\n\n- Add `style` (TEXT) column to moves\n- Rename `professional` → `master` in level values\n- Add `move_type` (TEXT) and `view_count` (INTEGER DEFAULT 0) columns\n- Create `user_favorites` junction table\n\n## Execution Order\n1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6 → 7 (8–9 deferred)"}}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:20:38.814Z","type":"tool","step":"IDLE","details":{"toolName":"mdocs","args":{"command":"initiative.create","args":{"id":"vitest-browser-svelte-bug","title":"vitest-browser-svelte Svelte 5 Compatibility Bug","tags":["bug","testing","vitest","svelte5","blocked"],"objective":"Track and resolve the vitest-browser-svelte compatibility bug with Svelte 5 component tests that have nested object props.","plan":"## Issue\n\n`vitest-browser-svelte@2.0.1` and `@2.1.0` have a bug causing Svelte 5 component tests to fail when rendering components with nested object props:\n\n```\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'includes')\n❯ render node_modules/vitest-browser-svelte/src/pure.js:43:18\n```\n\n**Affected:** `src/lib/components/MoveCard.svelte.spec.ts` — all 16 browser tests fail\n**Working:** Server-side tests, simpler component tests\n\n## Workaround Options\n\n1. Skip browser tests — use `describe.skip`\n2. Rewrite as server tests\n3. Use `@testing-library/svelte` as alternative\n\n## Resolution Path\n\n1. Check if issue is reported on vitest-browser-svelte GitHub\n2. If not, file a bug report\n3. Monitor for fix, remove workarounds when resolved"}}}}
