onfig.js`, `src/lib/server/db/index.ts`, `src/routes/+page.server.ts`, or `src/routes/admin/+page.server.ts`? List any overlap.\n\n5. **#137 standalone check**:\n   - Confirm #137 is unique (no duplicates). It touches `src/lib/components/Header.svelte` and `src/lib/components/SearchBar.svelte`. Verify it doesn't touch any file that another surviving PR also touches.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReturn a single Markdown report with these sections:\n- `## Cluster A — db.batch` — superset analysis, recommended merge (#X), 3 closes, with file:line citations.\n- `## Cluster B — CSP + Security Headers` — side-by-side diff summary, recommendation (merge one, or merge in order).\n- `## Cluster C — Category UX` — superset analysis, recommended merge (#X), close the other.\n- `## Cross-Cluster Conflict Matrix` — table of files × surviving PRs, marking conflicts.\n- `## Standalone PR #137` — confirmed clean.\n- `## Final Recommended Action Set` — bulleted list: `[MERGE] #N`, `[CLOSE] #N — reason: …`.\n\nBe precise. Cite file paths and line numbers. Do not paraphrase code — quote it. Do not run `npm` commands or commit anything. Read-only review.","subagent_type":"general"}}}
