{"timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:50:10.872Z","type":"tool","step":"IDLE","details":{"toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"cd /Users/bbaaxx/Code/projects/aerialdb && gh pr merge 138 --squash --delete-branch --subject \"🛡️ Sentinel: harden security headers and implement CSP (#138)\" --body \"Squash-merged from #138.\n\nImplements:\n- Content Security Policy via svelte.config.js \\`kit.csp\\` in nonce mode, with 'unsafe-inline' in style-src to preserve Svelte transition functionality across 5 call sites (Header.svelte ×3, admin/moves/[id]/edit/+page.svelte, admin/categories/+page.svelte).\n- HSTS preload directive in hooks.server.ts.\n- 'cache' added to Clear-Site-Data in logout endpoint, refactored to use event.setHeaders() for reliable header delivery alongside redirect.\n- Defensive CSP directives: base-uri, form-action, frame-ancestors: ['none'], upgrade-insecure-requests: true.\n- Whitelisted YouTube embeds (i.ytimg.com) and R2 storage (https://*.r2.dev) for img-src.\n\nCloses: supersedes #135 (which had a CSP style-src without 'unsafe-inline' that would have broken Svelte transitions in production).\" 2>&1 | tail -20","description":"Squash-merge PR #138"}}}
