{"timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:50:57.005Z","type":"tool","step":"IDLE","details":{"toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"cd /Users/bbaaxx/Code/projects/aerialdb && gh pr merge 137 --squash --delete-branch --subject \"🎨 Palette: Improve search input consistency and accessibility (#137)\" --body \"Squash-merged from #137.\n\nImproves search input consistency and accessibility across Header.svelte and SearchBar.svelte:\n- Standardize to type='search' for correct mobile keyboard (shows 'Search' action button on iOS/Android).\n- Increase focus ring from ring-1 to ring-2 for better keyboard/screen-reader visibility.\n- Add focus-visible styles to search clear buttons with aria-label.\n- Suppress native browser search decoration (::-webkit-search-cancel-button) to avoid clashing with custom UI.\n- Localize placeholders and ARIA labels in SearchBar.svelte via Paraglide messages.\n\nNo file conflicts with #138 or #139.\" 2>&1 | tail -10 && echo \"---#137 verify---\" && gh pr view 137 --json state,mergedAt 2>&1 | head -5","description":"Squash-merge PR #137"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:51:10.990Z","type":"tool","step":"IDLE","details":{"toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"cd /Users/bbaaxx/Code/projects/aerialdb && gh pr merge 136 --squash --delete-branch --subject \"🎨 Palette: Improve Category Management UX and Accessibility (#136)\" --body \"Squash-merged from #136.\n\nImproves the Admin Category Management page in src/routes/admin/categories/+page.svelte:\n- Loading states for Create, Update, and Delete actions (spinners + disabled buttons with disabled:cursor-not-allowed).\n- aria-invalid attributes on both the new-category and edit-category inputs.\n- Input disabled hardening: new-category input disabled during isSubmitting; edit input disabled during processingId === category.id.\n- Row-actions conflict prevention: hides the delete/edit column while the inline edit form is active, preventing conflicting button clicks.\n\nCloses: supersedes #131 (which only added loading states; #136 is a strict superset that adds a11y, input disabled hardening, and conflict prevention).\" 2>&1 | tail -10 && echo \"---#136 verify---\" && gh pr view 136 --json state,mergedAt 2>&1 | head -5 && echo \"---final dev log---\" && git fetch origin --quiet && git log --oneline -6 origin/dev","description":"Squash-merge PR #136 and verify"}}}
